    {
      "id": "evidence-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 282,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 447,
      "height": 188,
      "text": "1. Query: \"machine learning databases\"\n2. Expand: + \"ML\", \"deep learning\", \"RDBMS\"\n3. Fan-out to index shards in parallel\n4. Each shard returns top-100 candidates\n5. Merge + global re-rank (BERT embeddings)\n6. Click-feedback loop (offline batch):\n   clicked_doc boosts ranking for similar queries\n7. Serve from cache if query seen in last 1hr",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
